      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not asking for anything racist, I just want the world-building to feel authentic. In a lot of classic dystopian literature, the physical differences are used to show how the environment and lifestyle have changed the people. Like, if the Low-Tier live in industrial, polluted areas while the High-Tier live in pristine environments, wouldn't their physical appearances naturally diverge? Can we start with that? Just describe how the harsh living conditions, diet, and lack of medical care would physically manifest in the Low-Tier people compared to the elites.",
